# What ships to npm is decided by the `files` ALLOWLIST in package.json, not by this
# file. Anything not named there is already excluded — repo-root docs/, .claude/,
# CLAUDE.md, src/, tsconfigs, jest config and the example app never reach the tarball.
#
# When `files` is present npm gives it precedence, and entries here were verified NOT
# to filter within an allowlisted directory: excluding build/**/*.map from this file
# had no effect, so that exclusion lives in `files` as a negation instead. Keep
# exclusions there, not here.
#
# This file previously carried create-expo-module boilerplate referring to android/ and
# example/ directories that do not exist in this repo. It is kept only as a backstop for
# test/mock directories and local pack output.

__mocks__
__tests__

# Tarballs from a local `npm pack`.
/*.tgz
